[{"id":"app-testing-device-selector","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["ADB","多设备"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(四)ADB 设备管理.md","articleTitle":"App测试(四)ADB 设备管理","articlePath":"posts/7c0260ba/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(四)ADB 设备管理.md","articleTitle":"App测试(四)ADB 设备管理","articlePath":"posts/7c0260ba/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多设备执行 ADB 脚本时，最小的目标隔离措施是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>把 serial 显式传给每条命令，并回读型号或状态确认目标。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>ADB server 会同时维护多个 transport；未指定目标的命令可能失败，也可能在环境变化后作用于错误设备。将目标写入变量、绑定每条命令并在关键动作后回读，可以把误操作从隐性风险变成可审计错误。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">target=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;&lt;serial&gt;&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">adb -s \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$target\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> get-state\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">adb -s \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$target\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> shell getprop ro.product.model\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-CAP-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","502","504","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":11,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>看到 502/504 还能继续抓 TCP 吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>可以，但问题已经至少到达某个 HTTP 网关；还要检查客户端到网关以及网关到上游的两段链路。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>只在客户端重复抓包可能看不到真正故障段，应同时看网关到上游的 DNS、TCP、TLS 和超时日志。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>看到 502/504 后，客户端到网关的 TCP 仍值得检查，但还不够：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>段\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>应检查\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>客户端 → 网关\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>DNS、TCP、TLS、请求\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>网关 → 上游\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>DNS、TCP、TLS、分帧、超时\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>HTTP 错误说明至少有网关响应，真正根因可能只出现在第二段。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-008","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","关闭","FIN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 常说的“四次挥手”为什么不是固定四个独立报文？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>两个方向可以独立结束，ACK 可能与数据或 FIN 合并，双方也可能同时关闭；四段只是常见时序。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>FIN 表示本方向不再发送字节，对端仍可能继续发送。应按状态和报文方向解释，而不是把四次当成不可变的脚本。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>关闭问题先标注方向，再判断状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>语义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>FIN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仅一个方向结束\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>看对端是否继续发送\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CLOSE-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>本端收到 FIN 但应用未关闭\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查资源释放路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TIME-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>主动关闭方等待旧报文消失\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查短连接与复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>RST\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>立即重置\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查未监听、异常关闭或错误路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a9-coredump","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["崩溃","coredump"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>coredumpctl list 能否直接证明崩溃原因？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能，它只说明系统记录了转储；需要 info、符号和调用栈，并结合服务日志复核。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>list\u003c/code> 只回答“有没有记录”，还不能回答“为什么崩溃”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">coredumpctl list --since \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-08-26 10:00:00&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">coredumpctl info &lt;PID-or-match&gt;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">coredumpctl debug &lt;PID-or-match&gt;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>真正的原因需要调用栈、符号文件和相邻服务日志共同支持；优化构建、剥离符号或缺少权限都可能让栈不完整。转储可能包含口令、请求内容和内存中的用户数据，导出与保留应在获准的隔离环境完成。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a13-handoff","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["交接","复盘"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一份可复用的 Linux 故障交接至少包含什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>影响范围、时间窗、命令与关键输出、已证实/排除的假设、变更动作、复测结果和后续计划。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>交接记录可以按三栏组织：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>类型\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>示例\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>要求\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>观察\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 返回 502，10:02～10:05 持续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>带命令、时间和关键输出\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>推断\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>上游连接池耗尽，待日志确认\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>写出支持与反证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>行动\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>限流配置已回滚，10:10 复测恢复\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录批准、变更和结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>把“看到的事实”和“对原因的解释”分开，接手者才能重新运行命令、验证假设，而不是只能相信上一位工程师的一句结论。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-raises-match","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["异常"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断","articlePath":"posts/ac715911/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断","articlePath":"posts/ac715911/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>pytest.raises\u003c/code> 只匹配异常类型为什么不够？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>同一异常类型可能对应不同原因，应使用 \u003ccode>match\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>check\u003c/code> 验证稳定的消息片段和异常属性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>异常类型只说明“哪一类错误”，不说明错误是否由正确原因触发。应把对调用者有意义的契约写出来：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> pytest.raises(ValueError, \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">match\u003c/span>=\u003cspan class=\"string\">r&quot;limit must be positive&quot;\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    parse_limit(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 在支持 check 的版本中，还能检查结构化属性。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> pytest.raises(DomainError, check=\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">lambda\u003c/span> error: error.code == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;LIMIT&quot;\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    parse_limit(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;0&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>match\u003c/code> 适合稳定的消息片段；新版本支持的 \u003ccode>check\u003c/code> 更适合检查异常属性。不要断言完整日志，也不要只验证抛错而忘记检查数据库、文件等副作用是否保持不变。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-quality-assert","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","assert","测试","不变量"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不能用 assert 校验用户输入或权限？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>优化模式可移除 assert，因此它不能承担生产环境必须执行的校验。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>assert\u003c/code> 的语义是“这里按设计不应失败”，而不是生产输入校验。优化模式 \u003ccode>python -O\u003c/code> 会移除断言，因此安全边界必须写成普通条件：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">authorize\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">user, resource\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">not\u003c/span> user.can_read(resource):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">raise\u003c/span> PermissionError(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;read denied&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> resource.owner_id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">not\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 内部不变量，可以被优化掉\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>用户输入、权限、金额范围和外部数据要使用显式条件、异常或错误结果，确保不同运行模式都执行。断言可以帮助开发期尽早发现程序自身的逻辑破坏，但不能承担必须生效的契约。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]